  "body": "## Release Notes\n\n### Other\n\n- *(deps)* bump webbrowser from 1.2.4 to 1.2.5 ([#747](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/pull/747))\n- *(deps)* bump tokio from 1.54.0 to 1.54.1 ([#748](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/pull/748))\n- *(deps)* bump aws-config from 1.12.0 to 1.13.0 ([#749](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/pull/749))\n- *(deps)* bump google-cloud-auth from 1.17.0 to 1.18.0 ([#750](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/pull/750))\n\n## Install flowrs-tui 0.16.2\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via shell script\n\n```sh\ncurl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -LsSf https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.2/flowrs-tui-installer.sh | sh\n```\n\n### Install prebuilt binaries via Homebrew\n\n```sh\nbrew install jvanbuel/flowrs/flowrs\n```\n\n## Download flowrs-tui 0.16.2\n\n|  File  | Platform | Checksum |\n|--------|----------|----------|\n| [flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.2/flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Apple Silicon macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.2/flowrs-tui-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.2/flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz) | Intel macOS | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.2/flowrs-tui-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.xz.sha256) |\n| [flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.2/flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz) | x64 Linux | [checksum](https://github.com/jvanbuel/flowrs/releases/download/flowrs-tui-v0.16.2/flowrs-tui-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.xz.sha256) |\n\n\n"
